'''Alois''' (アロイス) is an enemy that only appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Alois
|image = E 165.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
}}

==Enemy==
Rather weak on low buffs, but then he becomes a bigger threat on high buff stages in which he can push with a surprising ease.

==Strategy==
He tends to come in swarms and create a good pushing DPS so tankers aren't the best choice, instead use midrange units with area attack like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] to counter them.

